    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/2f312778eecaa21ec99c983579a69fcc.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/2f312778eecaa21ec99c983579a69fcc.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/2f312778eecaa21ec99c983579a69fcc.mp4?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/5287a3d8ecc06fe05499bbbfb634a10c.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=384 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/5287a3d8ecc06fe05499bbbfb634a10c.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos reigns as up to 4 friends battle in a magical, explosive local-multiplayer showdown. Create your wizard, choose your magical affinity, mix elements, and craft explosive potion bombs to dominate the arena. Even in defeat, haunt and sabotage rivals as a ghost, seizing a second chance at glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of unique stages, power-ups, and sudden-death hazards that change the flow of battle, keeping each match dynamic and full of surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your wizard with a wide variety of robes, hairstyles, and hats, and unlock new cosmetic items to stand out in every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/cba7ea4754ce988d8f9b83fb777649ab.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/cba7ea4754ce988d8f9b83fb777649ab.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/cba7ea4754ce988d8f9b83fb777649ab.mp4?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/155c13f2de87350fb53de4e9407e80ab.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/155c13f2de87350fb53de4e9407e80ab.apng?t=1754412793\" class=\"bb_img\" width=593 height=72 /></picture></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explosive Competition</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with up to 4 friends in chaotic local-multiplayer battles, using potions as devastating bombs to create explosive mayhem.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use ghost mechanics to sabotage and reclaim victory after elimination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive sudden-death stage events to outlast your foes. <br> <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/96051b1f29ffe863d4d6add690788bf4.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/96051b1f29ffe863d4d6add690788bf4.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/96051b1f29ffe863d4d6add690788bf4.mp4?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/0bd80ee36f383d1d7a70e8b618d1d7df.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=593 height=72 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/0bd80ee36f383d1d7a70e8b618d1d7df.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Potion Bomb Combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from four magical affinities: Earth, Fire, Ice, and Arcane.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment by mixing magical elements to create powerful effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up items for buffs, stage-wide effects, or unpredictable twists.  <br>  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/9e23911146d4b39bbf8444acb8a079c5.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/9e23911146d4b39bbf8444acb8a079c5.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/9e23911146d4b39bbf8444acb8a079c5.mp4?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/0720f36895b220e245be10ac80f9f9e1.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/0720f36895b220e245be10ac80f9f9e1.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/0720f36895b220e245be10ac80f9f9e1.mp4?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> \u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/88e340b4ab8e6ef98524b0c060062102.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=593 height=72 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/88e340b4ab8e6ef98524b0c060062102.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends over for local matches or play via Remote Play Together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced matches perfect for casual and competitive players alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player can create a personalized profile to track and expand their unique collection of cosmetics.<br>  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/ef0556e52bea03fe070fa46e322ba4df.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/ef0556e52bea03fe070fa46e322ba4df.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/ef0556e52bea03fe070fa46e322ba4df.mp4?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/4583bdd792ab5b635ac06b1a4b84607e.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=593 height=72 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/4583bdd792ab5b635ac06b1a4b84607e.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Customization</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your wizard with robe colors, hairstyles, and quirky hats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn stars by winning matches and spend them to unlock new cosmetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your luck with the gacha machine for randomized cosmetic rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/801b728832390684eb6ed3bfdacdc6cb.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/801b728832390684eb6ed3bfdacdc6cb.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/801b728832390684eb6ed3bfdacdc6cb.mp4?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/d8dc34cbbf0c95ca11a2eb869686b407.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/d8dc34cbbf0c95ca11a2eb869686b407.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/d8dc34cbbf0c95ca11a2eb869686b407.mp4?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/5c04bc7359915adeac861768cbac5a3d.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/5c04bc7359915adeac861768cbac5a3d.apng?t=1754412793\" class=\"bb_img\" width=770 height=160 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURE LIST</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena Battles</strong>: Engage in local multiplayer matches for up to 4 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical Affinities</strong>: Experiment with Earth, Fire, Ice, and Arcane elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Element Mixing</strong>: Combine magical elements to craft devastating potions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scrolls of Chaos</strong>: Enhance your powers with buffs, summon hazards, or trigger game-changing arena events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghost Comebacks</strong>: Sabotage rivals with their potions or through possession as a ghost and reclaim victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Wizards</strong>: Create unique wizards with hundreds of combinations of robe colors, hairstyles, and hats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gacha System</strong>: Win matches and collect stars to use in the gacha machine. Unlock randomized cosmetic rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Stages</strong>: Battle on multiple arenas with unique hazards and sudden-death mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Mode Customization:</strong>\u00a0Adjust match settings to create unique battles, from subtle rule tweaks to chaotic arena modifiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Fun</strong>: Quick, intense matches for casual and competitive players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/d9081c0be960f84a7006c1260ab66b87.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/d9081c0be960f84a7006c1260ab66b87.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/d9081c0be960f84a7006c1260ab66b87.mp4?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/2d92fd72107b1860e6da002f95f68e9b.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/2d92fd72107b1860e6da002f95f68e9b.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/2d92fd72107b1860e6da002f95f68e9b.mp4?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/5a82ebe7d1eeba57016b0bc1fac7a293.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=593 height=72 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/5a82ebe7d1eeba57016b0bc1fac7a293.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/2f312778eecaa21ec99c983579a69fcc.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/2f312778eecaa21ec99c983579a69fcc.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/2f312778eecaa21ec99c983579a69fcc.mp4?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/5287a3d8ecc06fe05499bbbfb634a10c.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=384 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/5287a3d8ecc06fe05499bbbfb634a10c.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos reigns as up to 4 friends battle in a magical, explosive local-multiplayer showdown. Create your wizard, choose your magical affinity, mix elements, and craft explosive potion bombs to dominate the arena. Even in defeat, haunt and sabotage rivals as a ghost, seizing a second chance at glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of unique stages, power-ups, and sudden-death hazards that change the flow of battle, keeping each match dynamic and full of surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your wizard with a wide variety of robes, hairstyles, and hats, and unlock new cosmetic items to stand out in every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/cba7ea4754ce988d8f9b83fb777649ab.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/cba7ea4754ce988d8f9b83fb777649ab.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/cba7ea4754ce988d8f9b83fb777649ab.mp4?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/155c13f2de87350fb53de4e9407e80ab.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/155c13f2de87350fb53de4e9407e80ab.apng?t=1754412793\" class=\"bb_img\" width=593 height=72 /></picture></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explosive Competition</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with up to 4 friends in chaotic local-multiplayer battles, using potions as devastating bombs to create explosive mayhem.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use ghost mechanics to sabotage and reclaim victory after elimination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive sudden-death stage events to outlast your foes. <br> <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/96051b1f29ffe863d4d6add690788bf4.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/96051b1f29ffe863d4d6add690788bf4.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/96051b1f29ffe863d4d6add690788bf4.mp4?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/0bd80ee36f383d1d7a70e8b618d1d7df.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=593 height=72 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/0bd80ee36f383d1d7a70e8b618d1d7df.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Potion Bomb Combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from four magical affinities: Earth, Fire, Ice, and Arcane.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment by mixing magical elements to create powerful effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up items for buffs, stage-wide effects, or unpredictable twists.  <br>  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/9e23911146d4b39bbf8444acb8a079c5.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/9e23911146d4b39bbf8444acb8a079c5.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/9e23911146d4b39bbf8444acb8a079c5.mp4?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/0720f36895b220e245be10ac80f9f9e1.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/0720f36895b220e245be10ac80f9f9e1.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/0720f36895b220e245be10ac80f9f9e1.mp4?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> \u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/88e340b4ab8e6ef98524b0c060062102.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=593 height=72 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/88e340b4ab8e6ef98524b0c060062102.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends over for local matches or play via Remote Play Together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced matches perfect for casual and competitive players alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player can create a personalized profile to track and expand their unique collection of cosmetics.<br>  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/ef0556e52bea03fe070fa46e322ba4df.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/ef0556e52bea03fe070fa46e322ba4df.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/ef0556e52bea03fe070fa46e322ba4df.mp4?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/4583bdd792ab5b635ac06b1a4b84607e.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=593 height=72 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/4583bdd792ab5b635ac06b1a4b84607e.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Customization</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your wizard with robe colors, hairstyles, and quirky hats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn stars by winning matches and spend them to unlock new cosmetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your luck with the gacha machine for randomized cosmetic rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/801b728832390684eb6ed3bfdacdc6cb.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/801b728832390684eb6ed3bfdacdc6cb.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/801b728832390684eb6ed3bfdacdc6cb.mp4?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/d8dc34cbbf0c95ca11a2eb869686b407.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/d8dc34cbbf0c95ca11a2eb869686b407.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/d8dc34cbbf0c95ca11a2eb869686b407.mp4?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/5c04bc7359915adeac861768cbac5a3d.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/5c04bc7359915adeac861768cbac5a3d.apng?t=1754412793\" class=\"bb_img\" width=770 height=160 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURE LIST</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena Battles</strong>: Engage in local multiplayer matches for up to 4 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical Affinities</strong>: Experiment with Earth, Fire, Ice, and Arcane elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Element Mixing</strong>: Combine magical elements to craft devastating potions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scrolls of Chaos</strong>: Enhance your powers with buffs, summon hazards, or trigger game-changing arena events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghost Comebacks</strong>: Sabotage rivals with their potions or through possession as a ghost and reclaim victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Wizards</strong>: Create unique wizards with hundreds of combinations of robe colors, hairstyles, and hats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gacha System</strong>: Win matches and collect stars to use in the gacha machine. Unlock randomized cosmetic rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Stages</strong>: Battle on multiple arenas with unique hazards and sudden-death mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Mode Customization:</strong>\u00a0Adjust match settings to create unique battles, from subtle rule tweaks to chaotic arena modifiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Fun</strong>: Quick, intense matches for casual and competitive players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/d9081c0be960f84a7006c1260ab66b87.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/d9081c0be960f84a7006c1260ab66b87.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/d9081c0be960f84a7006c1260ab66b87.mp4?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/2d92fd72107b1860e6da002f95f68e9b.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/2d92fd72107b1860e6da002f95f68e9b.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/2d92fd72107b1860e6da002f95f68e9b.mp4?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/5a82ebe7d1eeba57016b0bc1fac7a293.poster.avif?t=1754412793\" width=593 height=72 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433720/extras/5a82ebe7d1eeba57016b0bc1fac7a293.webm?t=1754412793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
